text @[Kotomi]
text What was it?
text When she looks directly at me, I remember that embarrassing phrase.
text "I'm not right now, but I would like to be in the future."
text That's right. I haven't confessed to Kotomi yet.
text Since everyone treated us like a couple yesterday, it felt like that step had already been dealt with.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text Would it be better if I just confessed to her?
text Keeping things the way they are probably wouldn't be good for either one of us.
text In order to move forward, we can't just stay regular friends.
text Knowing Kotomi, she might say yes as if it were nothing.
text I get the feeling that I'll only get question marks from her.
text I might get to see the wonderful sight of her turning red.
text But there's also the chance that she'll just make some dumb remark.
text I really can't predict what the results would be.
