label s14
text It's the kind of smile that makes me want to be with her forever.
text Despite that, I feel a pain deep inside my heart.
text I still remember those words.
sound VYC.aac
text "If you see her, please convey a message for me."
sound VYD.aac
text "We still regret what we did that day."
text I still don't know what they mean.
text The weight of the word "regret" rests heavily in my heart.
text I consider it once more.
text Should I tell Kotomi about it?
choice Tell her what the gentleman said|Don't tell her yet
setvar intF[1089] = selected
