text She listens intently with her usual expression.
text @[Tomoya]
text "I don't expect forgiveness, but we still regret what we did that day," is what he said.
text @[Tomoya]
text I didn't understand what he was talking about, so I didn't ask for more details.
text @[Tomoya]
text But he was really serious when he said that.
text Despite the weight of the words, I tried to say it as lightheartedly as possible.
text Kotomi stays silent.
